Pot Kharab lands may be classified as follows, -
a) That which is classified as unfit for agriculture at the time of survey including the farm building or threshing floors of the holder;
b) That which is not assessed because,
(i) It is reserved or assigned for public purpose;
(ii) It is occupied by a road or recognized footpath or by a tank or stream used by persons other than the holders for irrigation, drinking or domestic purposes;

